  "description": "Find the smallest subtree containing all the nodes that are at the deepest level of the tree.",
  "pseudocode": "function find(root) {\n  1. if (!root) return {node: null, depth: 0};\n  2. let l = find(root.left);\n  3. let r = find(root.right);\n  4. if (l.depth > r.depth) return {node: l.node, depth: l.depth + 1};\n  5. if (r.depth > l.depth) return {node: r.node, depth: r.depth + 1};\n  6. return {node: root, depth: l.depth + 1};\n}",
